<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Someone, hopefully you, asked to reset the password on your Ascent account.</p>

<%= render "devise/mailer/button", url: edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), label: "Choose a new password" %>

<p style="margin: 0;">This link works for <%= pluralize(Devise.reset_password_within.in_hours.to_i, "hour") %>. If you didn't ask, ignore this email and your password stays the same.</p>
